// walk-renew-carry.bml — the carry list the scratch walk of form-stdlib/tests/host-walk-band.bml (claim "renewal") builds its
// request with: a rule its door (walk-renew-door.bml) evaluates after its sync, as the night's movement request reads hw-learned.
// The band plants this file in a scratch origin beside the door, then moves the list on main under the walk; this copy is the
// list before the move, and the band's claim reads it so.
section [form.bml] {
 class WalkRenewCarry {
  def wrc-carry() = ["receipts/draft-ledger.jsonl"];
 }
}
